        {
            "id": 3,
            "module": "openai-gpt-3:askAnything",
            "version": 1,
            "parameters": {},
            "mapper": {
                "model": "gpt-5-nano",
                "textPrompt": "You turn raw meeting notes into a clear summary. Reply with a single JSON object and nothing else: no explanation and no markdown formatting.\n\nMeeting file name:{{1.name}}\nNotes:{{2.text}}\n\nReturn JSON with exactly these keys:\r\n\"meeting_title\": a short title for the meeting\r\n\"summary\": 3 to 4 plain sentences, 70 words or fewer, covering what the meeting was about and what was concluded\r\n\"decisions\": every decision that was actually made, as one string, with each decision separated by <br>\r\n\"action_items\": every task someone must do, as one string, with each item written as Owner: task (due: date) and separated by <br>\r\n\"open_questions\": anything raised but not decided, as one string separated by <br>, or \"None\"\r\n\r\nRules:\r\n- Ignore small talk, jokes, delays and technical hiccups.\n- Include agreed budgets and amounts in decisions.\r\n- Never invent an owner or a deadline. If no deadline was given, write (due: no deadline given). If no owner was named, write Owner: unassigned.\r\n- Something that was only suggested, discussed or left undecided belongs in open_questions, not decisions.\n- The summary must not repeat action items or list meeting logistics.\r\n- Do not use double quotation marks inside any value, so the JSON stays valid."
            },
            "metadata": {
                "designer": {
                    "x": 600,
                    "y": 0
                },
                "setupValidation": {
                    "version": 1,
                    "configuration": "182bd4e280907fc2",
                    "result": {
                        "valid": true,
                        "fields": []
                    }
                },
                "restore": {
                    "expect": {
                        "model": {
                            "label": "GPT-5 nanoThe most cost-effective option for casual conversation and straightforward, simple fact-retrieval"
                        }
                    }
                },
                "expect": [
                    {
                        "name": "model",
                        "type": "select",
                        "label": "Model",
                        "required": true,
                        "validate": {
                            "enum": [
                                "gpt-5-nano",
                                "gpt-6.1-sol",
                                "gpt-6-sol",
                                "gpt-6-luna",
                                "gpt-6-astra",
                                "gpt-5.6-sol",
                                "gpt-5.6-terra",
                                "gpt-5.6-luna",
                                "gpt-5.5",
                                "gpt-5.4-nano",
                                "gpt-5.4-mini",
                                "gpt-5.4",
                                "gpt-5.2",
                                "gpt-5.1",
                                "gpt-5",
                                "gpt-5-mini"
                            ]
                        }
                    },
                    {
                        "name": "textPrompt",
                        "type": "text",
                        "label": "Text prompt",
                        "required": true
                    }
                ]
            }
